{"_id":"KDA02F2waav2WhN5","name":"Muted Delver","type":"npc","img":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-pf2e/art/muted_delver.webp","items":[{"_id":"9yCNvijRRkUYZTyi","name":"Sealed Lips","type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>A muted delver cannot speak or otherwise vocalize, but it can still cast spells with verbal components. This doesn't change the number of actions required to cast the spell.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"interaction","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"UqO83v3pRsGYqPJx","name":"Aura of Quiet","type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>@Compendium[pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.v61oEQaDdcRpaZ9X]{Aura} 60 feet.</p>\n<p>A muted delver's aura softens sounds in the affected area. A creature that uses an ability or casts a spell with the auditory or sonic trait or a verbal component must succeed at a @Check[type:flat|dc:10|name:Aura of Quiet Flat Check DC|traits:aura, illusion, occult|showDC:owner]{Flat Check}; on a failure, the effect is counteracted.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["aura","illusion","occult"],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"defensive","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"b8wxIhkearQcoc34","name":"Visual Overload","type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>A muted delver's extremely sensitive eyes are susceptible to visual overload. Whenever a muted delver sees a spell used within @Template[type:emanation|distance:30]{30 feet} with the visual trait, the muted delver becomes @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.AJh5ex99aV6VTggg]{Off-Guard} and @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Fascinated]{Fascinated} for 1 round.</p>\n<p>The target of the muted delver's fascination is the origin of the effect, not the effect itself; for example, the delver would be fascinated by a wizard who casts <em>@Compendium[pf2e.spells-srd.f8SBoXiXQjlCKqly]{Illusory Creature}</em>, not the illusion itself.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"defensive","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"31VLv8CSnkgN1Uhd","name":"Wrecking Ball","type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/TwoActions.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The muted delver has a creature @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.kWc1fhmv9LBiTuei]{Grabbed} in its claw;</p>\n\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The muted delver swings the grabbed creature around, slamming it like a cudgel into up to two creatures within 15 feet. Each foe, including the grabbed creature, takes [[/r 5d8[bludgeoning]]] damage (@Check[type:fortitude|dc:30|name:Wrecking Ball DC|traits:damaging-effect|showDC:gm]{basic Fortitude} save). On a failed save, a creature is knocked @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.j91X7x0XSomq8d60]{Prone}; on a critically failed save, the creature is also @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{Stunned 2}.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"action"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":2},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"LfX2mJ1m2haDHBNU","name":"Improved Grab","type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/FreeAction.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{"core":{}},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.ImprovedGrab]</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"improved-grab","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"free"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""},"weapon":{"value":""}},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.i18TlebMzwONyPhI","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"6243Vhh2QTZ4NIAv","name":"Claw","type":"melee","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/melee.svg","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{},"system":{"description":{"value":"","gm":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"value":["reach-15"],"otherTags":[]},"damageRolls":{"aid25arqu1ka7s0lqnai":{"damage":"2d8+15","damageType":"slashing","category":null}},"bonus":{"value":22},"attackEffects":{"value":["improved-grab"]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"_migration":{"version":0.932,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}}},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"Ig2oKV7fpsfIFZK6","name":"Air Jet","type":"melee","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/melee.svg","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{},"system":{"description":{"value":"","gm":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"value":["air","range-increment-60"],"otherTags":[]},"damageRolls":{"lkr6bqngjiogfajfs4jw":{"damage":"2d8+15","damageType":"piercing","category":null}},"bonus":{"value":22},"attackEffects":{"value":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"_migration":{"version":0.932,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}}},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"YK61vNXRuMq0nGIw","name":"Occult Innate Spells","type":"spellcastingEntry","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/spellcastingEntry.svg","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"ability":{"value":"cha"},"spelldc":{"value":21,"dc":29,"mod":0},"tradition":{"value":"occult"},"prepared":{"value":"innate","flexible":false},"showSlotlessLevels":{"value":false},"proficiency":{"value":0},"slots":{"slot0":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot1":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot2":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot3":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot4":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot5":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot6":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot7":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot8":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot9":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot10":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot11":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0}},"autoHeightenLevel":{"value":null},"showUnpreparedSpells":{"value":true},"displayLevels":{}},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"erXMPIZqlFtS9FWJ","name":"Slow","type":"spell","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/slow.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{"core":{}},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You dilate the flow of time around the target, slowing its actions.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target is @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{Slowed 1} for 1 round.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target is @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{Slowed 1} for 1 minute.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The target is @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{Slowed 2} for 1 minute.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (6th)</strong> You can target up to 10 creatures.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"slow","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","manipulate"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","occult","primal"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":3},"requirements":"","target":{"value":"1 creature"},"range":{"value":"30 feet"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"1 minute","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":{"passive":null,"save":{"statistic":"fortitude","basic":false}},"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"YK61vNXRuMq0nGIw","heightenedLevel":6},"counteraction":false,"heightening":{"levels":{"6":{"target":{"value":"10 creatures"}}},"type":"fixed"}},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.WsUwpfmhKrKwoIe3","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"LgI30Vh62vWH1syl","name":"Vampiric Exsanguination","type":"spell","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/vampiric-exsanguination.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{"core":{}},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You draw in the blood and life force of other creatures through your outstretched arms. You deal 12d6 negative damage to living creatures in the area. You gain temporary Hit Points equal to half the damage a single creature takes from this spell; calculate these temporary Hit Points using the creature that took the most damage. You lose any remaining temporary Hit Points after 1 minute.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 2d6.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"vampiric-exsanguination","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","death","manipulate"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","divine","occult"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":6},"requirements":"","target":{"value":""},"range":{"value":""},"area":{"value":30,"type":"cone"},"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"","sustained":false},"damage":{"0":{"formula":"12d6","type":"void","category":null,"materials":[],"kinds":["damage"]}},"defense":{"passive":null,"save":{"statistic":"fortitude","basic":true}},"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"YK61vNXRuMq0nGIw","heightenedLevel":6},"counteraction":false,"heightening":{"type":"interval","interval":1,"damage":{"0":"2d6"}}},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.fd31tAHSSGXyOxW6","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"gCWdTUK4PxAGGWCQ","name":"Black Tentacles","type":"spell","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/black-tentacles.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{"core":{}},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>Oily black tentacles rise up and attempt to capture creatures in the area. Make spell attack rolls against the Fortitude DC of each creature in the area. Any creature you succeed against is @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.kWc1fhmv9LBiTuei]{Grabbed} and takes 3d6 bludgeoning damage. Whenever a creature ends its turn in the area, the tentacles attempt to grab that creature if they haven't already, and they deal 1d6 bludgeoning damage to any creature already Grabbed.</p>\n<p>The tentacles' Escape DC is equal to your spell DC. A creature can attack a tentacle in an attempt to release its grip. Its AC is equal to your spell DC, and it is destroyed if it takes 12 or more damage. Even if destroyed, additional tentacles continue to grow in the area until the duration ends. You can Dismiss the spell.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"black-tentacles","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","manipulate"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","occult"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":5},"requirements":"","target":{"value":""},"range":{"value":"120 feet"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"3"},"duration":{"value":"1 minute","sustained":false},"damage":{"0":{"formula":"3d6","type":"bludgeoning","category":null,"materials":[],"kinds":["damage"]}},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"YK61vNXRuMq0nGIw","heightenedLevel":5},"counteraction":false},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.2w4OpAGihn1JSHFD","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"nS1t3L8cREj0ljHT","name":"False Life","type":"spell","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/false-life.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{"core":{}},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You create a reservoir of vitality from necromantic energy, gaining a number of temporary Hit Points equal to 6 plus your spellcasting ability modifier.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The temporary Hit Points increase by 3.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"false-life","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","manipulate"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","occult"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":2},"requirements":"","target":{"value":""},"range":{"value":""},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"8 hours","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"YK61vNXRuMq0nGIw","heightenedLevel":5},"counteraction":false},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.8ViwItUgwT4lOvvb","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"jrE4UF3Z9CPFZHif","name":"Detect Magic","type":"spell","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/detect-magic.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{"core":{}},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You send out a pulse that registers the presence of magic. You receive no information beyond the presence or absence of magic. You can choose to ignore magic you're fully aware of, such as the magic items and ongoing spells of you and your allies.</p>\n<p>You detect illusion magic only if that magic's effect has a lower level than the level of your detect magic spell. However, items that have an illusion aura but aren't deceptive in appearance (such as an invisibility potion) typically are detected normally.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> You learn the school of magic for the highest-level effect within range that the spell detects. If multiple effects are equally strong, the GM determines which you learn.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (4th)</strong> As 3rd level, but you also pinpoint the source of the highest-level magic. Like for an imprecise sense, you don't learn the exact location, but can narrow down the source to within a 5-foot cube (or the nearest if larger than that).</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"detect-magic","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["cantrip","concentrate","detection","manipulate"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","divine","occult","primal"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":1},"requirements":"","target":{"value":""},"range":{"value":""},"area":{"value":30,"type":"emanation"},"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"YK61vNXRuMq0nGIw"},"counteraction":false},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.gpzpAAAJ1Lza2JVl","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"EQSIFeW1aXKWdcnT","name":"Shield","type":"spell","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/shield.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{"core":{}},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You raise a magical shield of force. This counts as using the Raise a Shield action, giving you a +1 circumstance bonus to AC until the start of your next turn, but it doesn't require a hand to use.</p>\n<p>While the spell is in effect, you can use the Shield Block reaction with your magic shield. The shield has Hardness 5. After you use Shield Block, the spell ends and you can't cast it again for 10 minutes. Unlike a normal Shield Block, you can use the spell's reaction against the magic missile spell.</p>\n<p>Heightening the spell increases the shield's Hardness.</p>\n<p>@Compendium[pf2e.spell-effects.Jemq5UknGdMO7b73]{Spell Effect: Shield}</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> The shield has Hardness 10.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (5th)</strong> The shield has Hardness 15.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (7th)</strong> The shield has Hardness 20.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (9th)</strong> The shield has Hardness 25.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"shield","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["cantrip","concentrate","force"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","divine","occult"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":1},"requirements":"","target":{"value":""},"range":{"value":""},"area":null,"time":{"value":"1"},"duration":{"value":"until the start of your next turn","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"YK61vNXRuMq0nGIw"},"counteraction":false},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.TVKNbcgTee19PXZR","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"eCdstwRHTqTt15jk","name":"Levitate (Self Only) (Constant)","type":"spell","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/levitate.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{"core":{}},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You defy gravity and levitate the target 5 feet off the ground. For the duration of the spell, you can move the target up or down 10 feet with a single action, which has the concentrate trait. A creature floating in the air from levitate takes a -2 circumstance penalty to attack rolls. A floating creature can spend an Interact action to stabilize itself and negate this penalty for the remainder of its turn. If the target is adjacent to a fixed object or terrain of suitable stability, it can move across the surface by climbing (if the surface is vertical, like a wall) or crawling (if the surface is horizontal, such as a ceiling). The GM determines which surfaces can be climbed or crawled across.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"levitate","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","manipulate"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","occult"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":3},"requirements":"","target":{"value":"self"},"range":{"value":"self"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"5 minutes","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"YK61vNXRuMq0nGIw","heightenedLevel":6},"counteraction":false},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.fI20AVwOzJMHXRdo","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"lu8hjJRr9mmeZ3fX","name":"True Seeing (Constant)","type":"spell","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/true-seeing.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{"core":{}},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You see things within 60 feet as they actually are. The GM rolls a secret counteract check against any illusion or transmutation in the area, but only for the purpose of determining whether you see through it (for instance, if the check succeeds against a polymorph spell, you can see the creature's true form, but you don't end the polymorph spell).</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"true-seeing","_migration":{"vers